      "message": "test(app): pin the ALC400G taper refusal at the door and at the post\n\nPR #1818 moved the guide-height refusal of a tapered wire cut to the\ncommand door (wire_edm::taper_door), so CreateOperation now refuses the\npunch that the test expected to create. The product refusal is correct;\nonly the test's expectation was stale. The test now asserts the door\nrefusal on the shipped file, and keeps the post refusal by making the op\non a copy with guide heights and posting after the shipped file is\nmounted again.\n\nFixes #1856\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
